    "html": "<p>A ball of mass 0.3 kg is attached to a light, inextensible string. It is rotated in a vertical circle. The length of the string is 0.6 m and the speed of rotation of the ball is 4 m s<sup>−1</sup>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the tension when the string is horizontal?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">5 N</li><li data-label=\"B\">8 N</li><li data-label=\"C\">11 N</li><li data-label=\"D\">13 N</li></ol>"
